OL,3,GNEWSATeen guilty of murdering boy, 14,
OL,4,Ain pre-arranged fight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who stabbed a 14-year-old
OL,7,Fboy to death in a "deliberate and
OL,8,Ffrenzied" attack during a pre-arranged
OL,9,Ffight on the Isle of Man has been found
OL,10,Fguilty of murder.
OL,12,FThe 16-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,13,Fbecause of his age, attacked
OL,14,FChristopher McBurnie in Ramsey on 29
OL,15,FMay last year after the pair rowed and
OL,16,Fchallenged each other in social media
OL,17,Fmessages.
OL,19,FChristopher was stabbed outside the
OL,20,Fboy's home after traveling to the
OL,21,Fnorthern town from Castletown after the
OL,22,Ffight was arranged Snapchat.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
